@startuml agentic_rag_architecture
!theme plain
title Turkish Medical Agentic RAG

package "Indexing (explicit lifecycle)" {
  [data/*.md] --> [Markdown loader]
  [Markdown loader] --> [# / ## parser]
  [# / ## parser] --> [384-token contextual chunks]
  [384-token contextual chunks] --> [E5 passage embeddings]
  [E5 passage embeddings] --> [Local Qdrant]
  [Corpus + settings] --> [Index manifest]
}

package "Retrieval" {
  [User search query] --> [E5 query embedding]
  [E5 query embedding] --> [Local Qdrant]
  [Local Qdrant] --> [Top-6 source-labelled evidence]
}

package "LangGraph" {
  [START] --> [Responder]
  [Responder] --> [Retrieval Tool] : one tool call
  [Retrieval Tool] --> [Pruner]
  [Pruner] --> [Responder] : labelled evidence
  [Responder] --> [Compactor] : final Turkish answer
  [Compactor] --> [END]
}

[Top-6 source-labelled evidence] --> [Retrieval Tool]

note right of [Index manifest]
Missing index: create
Exact match: reuse
Mismatch: fail until --force
end note

note right of [384-token contextual chunks]
page_content repeats:
# title
## optional subtitle
body
end note
@enduml
